### Samajh Backend API Requests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Health check - Expected 200 { "status": "ok" }
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION (PERSON 1)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 Register User 1 (Deepika) - Expected 201
# @name registerUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Deepika",
  "email": "deepika@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Save Token from Register
@authToken = {{registerUser.response.body.token}}

### 2.2 Register Duplicate Email - Expected 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Deepika Duplicate",
  "email": "deepika@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.3 Register Invalid Data (Short Password) - Expected 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Deepika",
  "email": "deepika@example.com",
  "password": "short"
}

### 2.4 Register Invalid Data (Invalid Email) - Expected 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Deepika",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.5 Login Success - Expected 200 OK
# @name loginUser
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "deepika@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.6 Login Failure (Wrong Password) - Expected 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "deepika@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 2.7 Login Failure (Non-existent Email) - Expected 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2.8 Get Current User (/me) Authenticated - Expected 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 2.9 Get Current User (/me) Without Token - Expected 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 2.10 Get Current User (/me) Invalid Token - Expected 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid_jwt_token_here

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. USER 2 REGISTRATION (For Cross-User Security Testing)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Register User 2 (Ramesh) - Expected 201
# @name registerUser2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ramesh",
  "email": "ramesh@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### User 2 Token
@user2Token = {{registerUser2.response.body.token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. DOCUMENT UPLOAD & ANALYSIS
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 Upload & Analyze Notice (Kannada) - Expected 201 Created
# @name analyzeDoc
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

kn
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="property_tax_notice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

%PDF-1.4 Mock PDF Content For Testing Samajh Hackathon
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Capture Created Document ID
@documentId = {{analyzeDoc.response.body.document.id}}

### 4.2 Upload & Analyze Notice (Hindi) - Expected 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

hi
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="electricity_bill.png"
Content-Type: image/png

Mock PNG bytes
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4.3 Upload with Invalid Language - Expected 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

fr
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="notice.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

Mock PDF Content
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4.4 Upload with Unsupported File Type - Expected 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

en
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="document.exe"
Content-Type: application/x-msdownload

Binary Executable
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 4.5 Upload with Missing File - Expected 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="language"

en
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. DOCUMENT RETRIEVAL & HISTORY
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 5.1 Get Document History for User 1 - Expected 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5.2 Get Single Document by ID - Expected 200 OK
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5.3 Cross-User Access Attempt (User 2 trying to read User 1's doc) - Expected 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user2Token}}

### 5.4 Get Non-existent Document - Expected 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. ASK QUESTIONS (AI Q&A)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 Ask Question in Kannada - Expected 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What happens if I miss this deadline?",
  "language": "kn"
}

### 6.2 Ask Question in Hindi - Expected 200 OK
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "क्या मुझे कोई जुर्माना देना होगा?",
  "language": "hi"
}

### 6.3 Ask Question with Invalid Language - Expected 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the penalty?",
  "language": "es"
}

### 6.4 Ask Question Cross-User Attempt - Expected 404 Not Found
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{user2Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can I see this document?",
  "language": "en"
}

### 6.5 Ask Question Unauthenticated - Expected 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Can I access this?",
  "language": "en"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. DELETE DOCUMENT
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### 7.1 Cross-User Delete Attempt (User 2 trying to delete User 1's doc) - Expected 404 Not Found
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{user2Token}}

### 7.2 Delete Document by Owner - Expected 200 OK { "success": true }
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7.3 Delete Again (Already deleted) - Expected 404 Not Found
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. UNKNOWN ROUTES (404 HANDLING)
### -------------------------------------------------------------

### Unknown endpoint - Expected 404 { "error": "Route not found." }
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown-resource
